<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rate drops to 7.03 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rate drops to 7.03 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 7.03 percent on Wednesday from 7.66 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
